      "value": "@{5acad9ecc9dba010c9c3ec68|full_name}: A few friends also asked about the environment as the avatar disappeared.\nThe HMD used is Rift and Index.\nTwo of Avatar Descriptor's Lower Body are unchecked.\nPriority is given to full tracking even when moving or jumping.\nIn this state, it may or may not disappear immediately and is not constant.\nSome people have the reproducibility to disappear quickly.\nIf it disappears, some people will see it depending on the angle of the camera.\nSimilar to Bounds culling behavior.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
    {
      "__v": 0,
      "_id": "61ae35683093fe6620206841",
      "author": {
        "_id": "60cb1fb048ea0a340b54e3d7",
        "alias": "Interior Gerbil",
        "aliasID": "65c4ece6ed6eefce4cc96d51",
        "anonymized": false,
        "avatarURL": "https://canny-assets.io/images/307433e94695129d9f7daa3d36b017b7.png",
        "created": "2021-06-17T10:10:56.720Z",
        "name": "emperorofmars",
        "serviceAccount": false,
        "urlName": "emperorofmars"
      },
      "authorID": null,
      "boardID": "58c62f2b3cf8f8367753b2f0",
      "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
      "created": "2021-12-06T16:08:08.994Z",
      "deleted": false,
      "fileURLs": [],
      "files": [],
      "imageURLs": [],
      "integrationSourceType": null,
      "internal": false,
      "itemSourceType": null,
      "likeCount": 0,
      "mentionedUserIDs": null,
      "mentionedUsers": [],
      "mergeID": null,
      "parentID": null,
      "pinned": false,
      "postDeleted": false,
      "postID": "60ff217edb8d681562e76caa",
      "private": false,
      "reactions": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This bug has been plaguing me for almost half a year. Recalibrating fullbody or reseting the avatar will fix it, until it happens again after 5-20 minutes. Interestingly enough, i was in a world which shows a 3d clone of your avatar, there with the same pattern, only the head started flickering/disappearing. Recalibrating fullbody fixed it for the same amount of time.\nI got a tip recently that having dynamic bones on the armature directly may cause it. I moved the dybone scripts to an gameobject sitting beside the armature, and it happend only once in the last two days (with about 12 hours of total playtime).\nInstead, the dynamic bones stop doing anything after a while in world. Recalibrateing fullbody will fix that as well. With the dybones on the armature directly, dybones would never break.\nI have a similar setup to op, Valve Index + 3 vive 2.0 trackers, Ryzen 3770x, rtx 3090, 32gb of ram, running on a sata ssd, with windows 10.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    }
